@baseUrl = http://localhost:4700
@jobId = replace-me

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Create quote text extraction job
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/extractions/text
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "2 PZA VALVULA DE COMPUERTA 2 PULGADAS CLASE 150",
  "source": "manual"
}

### Create quote document extraction job
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/extractions/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=QuoteBoundary

--QuoteBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="quote.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ./fixtures/quote.xlsx
--QuoteBoundary--

### Current-compatible create route
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/extract/jobs/text
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "10 M TUBO ACERO AL CARBON 2 PULGADAS CEDULA 40",
  "source": "email"
}

### Create seller-completed quote Excel job
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/extractions/quoted-excel
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=QuotedExcelBoundary

--QuotedExcelBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="seller-quote.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ./fixtures/seller-quote.xlsx
--QuotedExcelBoundary--

### Create supplier quote extraction job
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/extractions/supplier-quotes
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=SupplierQuoteBoundary

--SupplierQuoteBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="supplier-quote.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./fixtures/supplier-quote.pdf
--SupplierQuoteBoundary--

### Current-compatible seller Excel route
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/extract/jobs/quoted-excel
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=QuotedExcelCompatibilityBoundary

--QuotedExcelCompatibilityBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="seller-quote.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ./fixtures/seller-quote.xlsx
--QuotedExcelCompatibilityBoundary--

### Current-compatible supplier quote route
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/extract/jobs/supplier-quote
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=SupplierCompatibilityBoundary

--SupplierCompatibilityBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="supplier-quote.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./fixtures/supplier-quote.pdf
--SupplierCompatibilityBoundary--

### Job status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs/{{jobId}}

### Job result
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs/{{jobId}}/result

### Normalize missing products (async)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/assistance/missing-products/normalize
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "item_id": "tmp-1",
      "description_original": "TUBO ACERO AL CARBON CEDULA 40 4 PULGADAS",
      "cantidad": 10,
      "unidad_original": "MTS"
    }
  ]
}

### Normalize missing products (current synchronous compatibility route)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/normalize-missing
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "item_id": "tmp-1",
      "description_original": "TUBO ACERO AL CARBON CEDULA 40 4 PULGADAS",
      "cantidad": 10,
      "unidad_original": "MTS"
    }
  ]
}

### Suggest technical data (current synchronous compatibility route)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/procurement/technical-data/suggest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestedDescription": "TUBO ACERO AL CARBON SIN COSTURA 4 PULGADAS CEDULA 40 ASTM A106 GR B",
  "supplierDescription": "PIPE SMLS A106B 4IN SCH40",
  "existingAttributes": {}
}

### Suggest technical data in batch
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/procurement/technical-data/suggest-batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "itemId": "item-1",
      "requestedDescription": "VALVULA COMPUERTA 2 PULGADAS CLASE 150 BRIDADA"
    }
  ]
}

### Suggest quote catalog internal code
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/quote-catalogs/suggest-code
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "PAYMENT_TERMS",
  "label": "Pago de contado",
  "existingCodes": ["NET_30", "NET_60"]
}
